# Whobrey Studios — Project Runbook

Before non-trivial work, read **`docs/runbook/00_INDEX.md`** (North Star + links) and **`docs/runbook/04_CURRENT_STATE.md`** (what is shipped vs incomplete).

## Runbook map

| File | Use when |
|------|----------|
| `docs/runbook/00_INDEX.md` | Orientation, North Star, read order |
| `docs/runbook/01_ARCHITECTURE.md` | Stack, patterns, data flow, external APIs |
| `docs/runbook/02_COMPONENTS_AND_FILES.md` | Where code lives — routes, modules, config |
| `docs/runbook/03_RULES_AND_STANDARDS.md` | Conventions, git/commits, testing, gotchas |
| `docs/runbook/04_CURRENT_STATE.md` | Working vs incomplete vs next steps |

Also: `DESIGN.md`, `decisions_complete.md`, `web/AGENTS.md` (Next.js 16).

## Non-negotiables

- Production code lives in **`web/`** only (not `whobrey-studios-app/`).
- Import **`@/lib/auth`** — never `@/auth` in feature code.
- DB/domain logic in **`lib/data/`** — not in page components.
- Check **`decisions_complete.md`** before changing payments, revisions, or auth.
- Run **`npm run verify:tranche`** from `web/` before claiming core flows are done.
- Update runbook files when adding routes, env vars, or conventions.

## Commits

Format: `[WHO-123] :gitmoji: type(scope): summary` — gitmoji from gitmoji.dev. No commit trailers.
